sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User (web app)
    participant API as Lambda API
    participant DB as Supabase (PostgreSQL)
    User->>API: POST /api/import-match<br/>Match data, player mappings, teams, season
    API->>DB: Read selected teams and mapped player accounts
    DB-->>API: Teams and current player match histories
    API->>DB: Save new match records and updated stats atomically
    DB-->>API: Player updates committed
    API-->>User: Import summary with match ID and updated player count
